OL,3,GNEWSADozens of seabirds wash up dead or
OL,4,Adying in Orkney
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of seabirds have been found dead
OL,7,For dying on a beach in Orkney.
OL,9,FMany of the birds that have washed up
OL,10,Fat Scapa were guillemots, which spend
OL,11,Fmost of their adult life at sea.
OL,13,FNaturalist Martin Gray said 24 birds he
OL,14,Finspected were all emaciated, with the
OL,15,Fmuscle mass in their wings and legs
OL,16,Fgone.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
