OL,3,GNEWSADozens of seabirds wash up dead or
OL,4,Adying in Orkney
OL,5,
OL,6,FGray said the young birds had likely
OL,7,Flacked the experience to find food or
OL,8,Fcope with bad weather, adding: "It's
OL,9,Fvery sad, but we don't see the birds
OL,10,Fthat do make it so we have to hope
OL,11,Fthere hundreds out there feeding
OL,12,Fhappily."
